      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The standard work hours are 09:00\u201315:00\n(3 minutes in real time).\n\nIf
        you have completed all tasks,\nyou can end your shift at any time\nby selecting
        \u2018[P] End Work\u2019,\nregardless of the remaining time.\n\nPurchasing
        upgrades can improve\nyour work hours and performance."
